#: {{syn|en|frob|tweak}}
#: {{ux|en|I '''hacked''' in a fix for this bug, but we'll still have to do a real fix later.}}
# {{lb|en|computing}} To accomplish a difficult programming task.
#: {{ux|en|He can '''hack''' like no one else and make the program work as expected.}}
#* {{quote-journal
|en
|date=July 10, 2020
|author=Tiffany May; Austin Ramzy
|title=Hong Kong Police Raid Pollster on Eve of Pro-Democracy Camp Primary
|journal=w:The New York Times
|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20200710162149/https://www.nytimes.com/2020/07/10/world/asia/hong-kong-police-raid-pollster.html
