#: {{ux|en|I read up on dating tips so I can '''hack''' my sex life.}}
# {{senseid|en|crack}} {{lb|en|transitive|slang|computing}} To hack [[into]]; to gain unauthorized access to (a computer system, e.g., a website, or network) by manipulating code.
#: {{syn|en|crack}}
# {{lb|en|transitive|slang|computing|by extension}} To gain unauthorised access to a computer or online account belonging to (a person or organisation).
#: {{ux|en|When I logged into the social network, I discovered I'd been '''hacked'''.}}
# {{lb|en|intransitive|video gaming}} To [[cheat]] by using [[unauthorized]] [[modification]]s.
